WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.748
Across both settings, USIS-SAM sets a new state of
the art on USIS10K.

00:00:05.828 --> 00:00:07.997
In the class-agnostic task,

00:00:08.077 --> 00:00:14.907
localizing and masking salient objects regardless
of category, it reaches 59.7 mAP,

00:00:14.987 --> 00:00:21.902
beating the best salient method OQTR by 3.1 points,
the underwater WaterMask by 0.7,

00:00:21.982 --> 00:00:24.899
and the SAM-based RSPrompter by 1.5.

00:00:24.979 --> 00:00:29.062
In the harder multi-class task it scores 43.1 mAP,

00:00:29.142 --> 00:00:35.057
extending its lead to 4.4 points over WaterMask and
5.1 over RSPrompter.

00:00:35.137 --> 00:00:40.386
It also generalizes: retrained on the land-based
SIS10K dataset,

00:00:40.466 --> 00:00:43.550
it still outperforms prior approaches.
